Maricha asks what foe advised ruin of sons kingdom ministers --- Maricha says weak foes seek crushing by stronger --- Maricha calls unrestraining ministers death-worthy --- Maricha says ministers gain fortune by favor suffer by fault must curb straying king --- Maricha says dharma victory king-rooted sharp rule ruins subjects like sheep by jackal --- Maricha foretells king with army and rakshasas perishing --- Maricha warns Rama will kill Ravana soon after him --- Maricha warns fetching Sita erases Lanka and spurned counsel seals death